<title>USA: TABLE - Oncor Inc Q2 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Oncor Inc Q2 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>GAITHERSBURG, Md. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	    Six Months Ended</p>
<p>		     6/30/97     6/30/96	6/30/97	6/30/96</p>
