<p>		25,293,839   23,025,997   25,081,010   22,420,711</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the second quarter of 1996 included a non-recurring $2 million charge for the reevaluation of inventory and other one-time adjustments related to the discontinuation of certain products. The company said net losses were significantly impacted by non-cash, non-operating charges to interest expenses of $0.6 million and $2.8 million in the second quarter and first half, respectively, of 1997 compared with $0.7 million and $1.2 million, respectively, in the corresponding periods of 1996.</p>
